# TECNO-BG6 (Unisoc T606) Side Capacitive Fingerprint Sensor Key Layout
# Silences raw capacitive touch-navigation scancodes emitted by vendor fpsmgr
# (87, 103, 105, 106, 108, 116, 139, 172, 212) so Generic.kl can never wake
# the display or inject stray DPAD/HOME/POWER keys on unauthenticated touches.
# Real biometric unlock runs over HIDL FingerprintProvider + BiometricAuthGate.

key 999   UNKNOWN
